1D2G4thUdd6q3j8cQwsyAiAS|fc_0ef86f0825944dfa016a95aedfb55887d2b021683ae0e68f61","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items: none.\nOverall: 8/8 done, 0 open.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verify\" (2/2).\n  Research:\n    - [X] Read migration policy\n    - [X] Inspect schema and migration\n  Implement:\n    - [X] Repair migration.sql\n    - [X] Write preflight report\n    - [X] Write rollback and postcheck scripts\n    - [X] Write migration report\n  Verify:\n    - [X] Run migration idempotency check\n    - [X] Run rollback restoration check"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Research","tasks":[{"content":"Read migration policy","status":"completed"},{"content":"Inspect schema and migration","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Implement","tasks":[{"content":"Repair migration.sql","status":"completed"},{"content":"Write preflight report","status":"completed"},{"content":"Write rollback and postcheck scripts","status":"completed"},{"content":"Write migration report","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verify","tasks":[{"content":"Run migration idempotency check","status":"completed"},{"content":"Run rollback restoration check","status":"completed"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Verify","content":"Run rollback restoration check"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788194527857},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ef86f0825944dfa016a95aee1317c87d2973de332e54804f5\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"d9fda2ed-2ccf-4fb0-bb65-d288e2a1c31a\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"d9fda2ed-2ccf-4fb0-bb65-d288e2a1c31a\"}}"},{"type":"text","text":"Done.\n\nFiles changed:\n- `in/billingdb/migration.sql`\n- `in/billingdb/preflight_report.md`\n- `in/billingdb/rollback.sql`\n- `in/billingdb/postcheck.sql`\n- `in/billingdb/migration_report.md`\n\nWhat changed:\n- `migration.sql`\n  - wrapped the migration in `BEGIN IMMEDIATE … COMMIT`\n  - stages orphan payments into `payment_orphans` before rebuilding `payments`\n  - rebuilds `invoices` with `status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'open'`\n  - preserves invoice `created_at`\n  - rebuilds `payments` with `FOREIGN KEY (invoice_id) REFERENCES invoices(id)`\n  - uses `INSERT OR IGNORE` plus stable PKs so a second run does not duplicate rows\n  - restores `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON` after the migration\n- `rollback.sql`\n  - restores old table shapes:\n    - `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)`\n    - `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`\n  - merges `payment_orphans` back into `payments`\n  - drops `payment_orphans`\n  - leaves foreign keys off again to match the old package shape\n- `preflight_report.md`\n  - documents required preflight counts and the known orphan `p4`\n- `postcheck.sql`\n  - checks row counts, `status` null/open expectations, preserved `created_at`, preserved orphan `p4`, dangling payments, and `PRAGMA foreign_key_check`\n- `migration_report.md`\n  - documents behavior, expected post-migration state, rollback behavior, operator sequence\n\nVerification:\n- Executed `schema.sql` in a fresh SQLite database.\n- Applied `migration.sql` once.\n  - result: `invoices=3`, `payments=3`, `payment_orphans=1`\n  - `payment_orphans` contains `p4 / missing-invoice / 700 / 2024-01-07T10:00:00Z`\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_key_check` returned no rows\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_keys` was `1`\n- Applied `migration.sql` a second time.\n  - counts unchanged: `invoices=3`, `payments=3`, `payment_orphans=1`\n  - no duplication or corruption observed\n- Ran the logic from `postcheck.sql`.\n  - `null_status_count=0`\n  - `non_open_status_count=0`\n  - `preserved_invoice_created_at_count=3`\n  - `preserved_orphan_p4_count=1`\n  - `dangling_payment_count=0`\n- Applied `rollback.sql`.\n  - restored tables only: `invoices`, `payments`\n  - restored old shapes exactly\n  - restored payments rows including orphan `p4`\n  - `PRAGMA foreign_keys` was `0`\n\nConstraint checks:\n- `schema.sql`: unchanged\n- `migration_policy.md`: unchanged\n- orphan `p4`: preserved\n- no row deletion used as the solution\n- no external services or non-SQLite features used","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ef86f0825944dfa016a95aee2183c87d2b45f647270d6f3a8\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2010,"output":703,"cacheRead":27648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30361,"reasoningTokens":48,"cost":{"input":0.005025000000000001,"output":0.010545,"cacheRead":0.006912,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.022482000000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788194527883,"responseId":"resp_0ef86f0825944dfa016a95aee0486c87d294964f5829f4f7e7","duration":14076.377788999991,"ttft":1388.1132089999737}],"isTerminal":true}
